        "2. Apply the limit using 'scripts/setup_wired_limit.sh <MB>' or from Network & RDMA.": "2. Pas die limiet toe via 'scripts/setup_wired_limit.sh <MB>' of vanaf Netwerk & RDMA.",
        "2. Check throughput via `iperf3 -c 10.99.1.1` (TB3/4: ~26–37 Gbps, TB5: ~65–80+ Gbps).": "2. Kontroleer deurset via `iperf3 -c 10.99.1.1` (TB3/4: ~26–37 Gbps, TB5: ~65–80+ Gbps).",
        "2. Choose Open-Mic or Push-to-Talk and join the voice room.": "2. Kies Oop Mikrofoon of Druk-om-te-praat en sluit aan by die stemkamer.",
        "2. Click 'Reload Models' in Model Studio.": "2. Klik op 'Herlaai modelle' in Modelwerkwinkel.",
        "2. Compare the available remote version against your local build.": "2. Vergelyk die beskikbare afgeleë weergawe met jou plaaslike weergawe.",
        "2. Configure the 10.99.1.x Thunderbolt Bridge in 'Network & RDMA'.": "2. Konfigureer die 10.99.1.x Thunderbolt-brug in 'Netwerk & Direkte Geheue'.",
        "2. Copy or apply the generated config pointing to http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1.": "2. Kopieer of pas die gegenereerde konfigurasie toe wat na http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1 wys.",
        "2. Inspect the 'Unified Memory Allocation' bar showing AI VRAM vs. protected macOS OS reserve.": "2. Inspekteer die balk 'Klustergeheue-toewysing' wat KI-VRAM teenoor beskermde macOS-reserwe wys.",
        "2. Launch the app using './scripts/run_ssccc.sh'.": "2. Begin die program met './scripts/run_ssccc.sh'.",
        "2. Open 'Cluster Overview' or 'Devices & Compare' to verify detected hardware and Rank 0 assignment.": "2. Maak 'Kluster-oorsig' of 'Toestelle & Vergelyking' oop om opgespoorde hardeware en Rang-0-toewysing te verifieer.",
        "2. Run N live benchmark trials or execute a Multi-Model-Mode (MMM) orchestration.": "2. Voer N lewendige maatstaflope uit of voer 'n Multi-Model-Mode (MMM)-orkestrasie uit.",
        "2. Run the WAN Bandwidth Monitor to capture live downlink, uplink, and RTT latency.": "2. Laat die WAN-bandwydtemonitor loop om lewendige aflaai, oplaai en RTT-latensie vas te lê.",
        "2. Select an Auto-Setup profile and click 'Auto-Configure'.": "2. Kies 'n Outo-opstellingprofiel en klik op 'Stel outomaties op'.",
        "3. Adjust the Voice/Alert mix ratio for clear team communication.": "3. Verstel die stem-/waarskuwingmengverhouding vir duidelike spankommunikasie.",
        "3. Apply the update in 1 click or pull and rebuild via SwiftPM.": "3. Pas die opdatering in 1 klik toe of trek en herbou via SwiftPM.",
        "3. Couple your local Thunderbolt core with the WAN pool via 'Local + Internet' scope.": "3. Koppel jou plaaslike Thunderbolt-kern aan die WAN-poel via die 'Plaaslik + Internet'-omvang.",
        "3. Export results as CSV, Markdown, or IEEE/ACM LaTeX from the History tab.": "3. Voer resultate direk vanaf die Geskiedenis-oortjie uit as CSV, Markdown of IEEE/ACM LaTeX.",
        "3. Fine-tune any slot afterwards (reorder, duplicate, edit model ID, URL, or VRAM) and save.": "3. Stel daarna enige gleuf fyn in (herrangskik, dupliseer, wysig model-ID, URL of VRAM) en stoor.",
        "3. Launch your runtime (oMLX, Ollama, or llama.cpp) on Rank 0 — SS-CCC shards model layers proportionally across available memory.": "3. Begin jou looptyd (oMLX, Ollama of llama.cpp) op Rang 0 — SS-CCC verdeel modellae eweredig oor beskikbare geheue.",
        "3. Load a single model or auto-import all discovered models into MMM.": "3. Laai 'n enkele model of voer alle ontdekte modelle outomaties in MMM in.",
        "3. Monitor live client throughput in 'API & Console' or 'Multi-Model-Mode'.": "3. Monitor lewendige kliëntdeurset in 'API & Konsole' of 'Multi-Model-Modus'.",
        "3. Run 'python3 tests/test_global_suite.py' after edits to verify all global checks pass.": "3. Voer 'python3 tests/test_global_suite.py' na wysigings uit om te verifieer dat alle globale toetse slaag.",
        "3. Toggle simulation off at bottom-left if needed — Bonjour detects connected Macs automatically.": "3. Skakel simulasie links onder af indien nodig — Bonjour bespeur gekoppelde Macs outomaties.",
